              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/shared/providers/1/availability?from=2026-12-01&to=2026-12-31",
            "description": "Slice 5a (approved contract revision 3). Public, no token needed (D93; auth.optional like the rest of discovery — a sent token must be valid). Provider not visible (D75) → 404. Returns unavailable Riyadh dates only — never reasons, times or ids (D86). A date is listed only when active blocks cover the whole Riyadh day, alone or together (D92): a whole-day block → listed; 13:00–17:00 only → not listed; 00:00–12:00 + 12:00–24:00 → listed; a one-minute gap → not listed; soft-deleted blocks ignored. from >= today (Riyadh), to >= from, at most 62 dates inclusive. A date-picker hint only: the direct-request create checks the exact interval (409 SLOT_UNAVAILABLE)."
          },
